                                "sense_id": "b4f30c88-6092-37a8-b6c4-71af897562dd",
                                "text": "We outreach for our own sake and need — not looking for the neediest recipient but instead searching for the guilt-resolve that fits best within our schedule. There is an inherent problem with this sort of unreach."
